---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About · CourtsAbove" description="Founded by Daniel Chin in Sydney, CourtsAbove writes songs that reflect God's love, holding to the historic Christian faith of the Nicene Creed." path="/about/" current="about">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="about-h" style="position: relative; min-height: 600px; display: flex; align-items: stretch; overflow: hidden; background: #16191D">
<img src="/images/about-hero.jpg" alt="Looking up at light pouring through stained glass windows" style="position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 35%">
<div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,14,20,0.22) 0%, rgba(10,14,20,0.28) 50%, rgba(10,14,20,0.5) 100%)"></div>
<div class="heroin" style="position: relative; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 600px; padding-top: 96px; padding-bottom: 56px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 36px">
<figure style="margin: auto 0; max-width: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<h1 id="about-h" style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.015em; text-align: center; color: #FFFFFF; text-shadow: 0 2px 28px rgba(10,14,20,0.45)"><span class="ql">Songs that reflect God’s Love.</span></h1>
<figcaption style="align-self: flex-end; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.5vw, 1.35rem); color: #E8EBEF">— About CourtsAbove</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="story-h" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; padding-top: 104px; padding-bottom: 104px">
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 420px), 1fr)); gap: 64px; align-items: center">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px">
<h2 id="story-h" style="margin: 0 0 0 -0.055em; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.015em">Our Story<svg viewBox="0 0 96 128" aria-hidden="true" style="height: 0.92em; width: auto; vertical-align: -0.08em; margin-left: 0.3em; color: #2F5683; overflow: visible">
<defs><filter id="roughChi" x="-10%" y="-10%" width="120%" height="120%"><feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.09" numOctaves="1" seed="8" result="e"></feTurbulence><feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" in2="e" scale="1.4" xChannelSelector="R" yChannelSelector="G"></feDisplacementMap></filter>
<mask id="dryChi" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="-6" y="-6" width="108" height="140"><rect x="-6" y="-6" width="108" height="140" fill="#fff"></rect><g stroke="#000" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"><path d="M45.2 6L45.4 20" stroke-width="0.4"></path><path d="M49.6 90L49.8 104" stroke-width="0.35"></path><path d="M80 98.4L86.6 104.2" stroke-width="0.4"></path><path d="M8.6 99.6L13.4 95.4" stroke-width="0.35"></path><path d="M72.2 12L74 18" stroke-width="0.35"></path></g></mask></defs>
<g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" filter="url(#roughChi)" mask="url(#dryChi)">
<path d="M47.2 1C48.6 30 48.6 72 48 127" stroke-width="10.4" stroke-linecap="butt"></path>
<path d="M50 4.6C64 3.4 74.6 8 75.6 17.6C76.6 27 67.4 32.6 52.6 33.8" stroke-width="8.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
<path d="M8 35.6C26 50 66 86 91.2 108.6" stroke-width="9.6" stroke-linecap="butt"></path>
<path d="M91.6 37.4C70 55 30 88 3.4 106.2" stroke-width="9.4" stroke-linecap="butt"></path>
</g>
</svg></h2>
<p style="margin: -6px 0 0; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.4; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: #2F5683">Daniel Chin <span aria-hidden="true" style="color: #5A5F66">·</span> <span style="color: #5A5F66">Founder</span> <span aria-hidden="true" style="color: #5A5F66">·</span> <span style="color: #5A5F66">Sydney, Australia</span></p>
<p class="dropcap" lang="en" style="margin: 0; max-width: 34em; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.6; text-align: justify; hyphens: auto; text-wrap: pretty">CourtsAbove is founded by Daniel Chin from Sydney, Australia. Daniel’s goal for CourtsAbove is to create a group of writers whose music reflects God’s love for us all. Daniel’s own writing is moved and inspired by God’s revelation found in scripture, apostolic tradition and liturgy. Having been exposed to both contemporary services and high-church liturgy, Daniel has a deep understanding of God’s love in a variety of contexts and music.</p>
</div>
<img src="/images/about-story.jpg" alt="Daniel Chin playing guitar outside a brick church" style="width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; object-fit: cover; display: block; border-radius: 4px">
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="creed-h" style="background: #16191D; color: #FFFFFF">
<div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; padding-top: 104px; padding-bottom: 104px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 48px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; max-width: 760px">
<h2 id="creed-h" style="margin: 0 0 0 -0.055em; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.2rem); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.015em">What We Believe<svg viewBox="0 0 68 98" aria-hidden="true" style="height: 0.95em; width: auto; vertical-align: -0.12em; margin-left: 0.3em; color: #FFFFFF; overflow: visible">
<defs><filter id="rough" x="-10%" y="-10%" width="120%" height="120%"><feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.12" numOctaves="2" seed="5" result="e"></feTurbulence><feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" in2="e" scale="1.8" xChannelSelector="R" yChannelSelector="G"></feDisplacementMap></filter><mask id="dry" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" x="-4" y="-4" width="78" height="106"><rect x="-4" y="-4" width="78" height="106" fill="#fff"></rect><g stroke="#000" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"><path d="M30.37 0.9L30.39 22.5" stroke-width="0.28"></path><path d="M30.8 0.3L30.76 18.5" stroke-width="0.27"></path><path d="M27.73 0.5L27.50 16.7" stroke-width="0.62"></path><path d="M29.32 3.8L29.26 32.5" stroke-width="0.51"></path><path d="M37.15 0.3L36.94 26.9" stroke-width="0.38"></path><path d="M28.23 1.9L28.28 27.5" stroke-width="0.33"></path><path d="M33.64 2.2L33.38 21.3" stroke-width="0.28"></path><path d="M29.14 4.1L29.19 20.4" stroke-width="0.39"></path><path d="M31.71 1.8L31.56 26.9" stroke-width="0.56"></path><path d="M32.97 3.2L32.84 30.2" stroke-width="0.58"></path><path d="M37.19 0.7L36.98 16.7" stroke-width="0.59"></path><path d="M32.09 0.2L32.13 22.2" stroke-width="0.59"></path><path d="M36.1 1.9L36.15 24.6" stroke-width="0.52"></path><path d="M31.74 5.0L31.84 33.7" stroke-width="0.46"></path><path d="M27.63 4.2L27.82 25.7" stroke-width="0.7"></path><path d="M29.96 2.3L29.94 24.3" stroke-width="0.26"></path><path d="M29.1 42.3L29.10 46.8" stroke-width="0.39"></path><path d="M28.73 45.0L28.73 52.1" stroke-width="0.42"></path><path d="M28.27 49.0L28.27 57.4" stroke-width="0.42"></path><path d="M35.28 57.3L35.28 63.5" stroke-width="0.3"></path><path d="M30.91 57.7L30.91 69.4" stroke-width="0.24"></path><path d="M29.17 44.6L29.17 50.5" stroke-width="0.32"></path><path d="M46.6 31.89L69 31.59" stroke-width="0.44"></path><path d="M49.7 29.69L69 29.96" stroke-width="0.56"></path><path d="M50.2 31.15L69 31.26" stroke-width="0.27"></path><path d="M51.8 35.0L69 35.22" stroke-width="0.61"></path><path d="M48.0 29.92L69 29.68" stroke-width="0.54"></path><path d="M44.7 26.62L69 26.45" stroke-width="0.32"></path><path d="M44.5 29.4L69 29.10" stroke-width="0.32"></path><path d="M47.6 27.01L69 26.73" stroke-width="0.64"></path><path d="M45.5 32.14L69 31.99" stroke-width="0.41"></path><path d="M45.2 29.64L69 29.85" stroke-width="0.7"></path><path d="M48.8 30.66L69 30.41" stroke-width="0.3"></path><path d="M46.6 29.43L69 29.63" stroke-width="0.32"></path><path d="M0 26.71L9.8 26.71" stroke-width="0.31"></path><path d="M0 27.82L7.7 27.82" stroke-width="0.21"></path><path d="M0 31.25L9.9 31.25" stroke-width="0.37"></path><path d="M0 32.77L6.3 32.77" stroke-width="0.27"></path></g></mask></defs>
<g fill="currentColor" filter="url(#rough)" mask="url(#dry)">
<path d="M26.2 7.2C29 5.6 33 2.8 36.6 0.6C37.4 0.2 38.1 0.6 38.1 1.6L38.4 24L38 60L38.3 95.4C38.3 96.2 37.8 96.8 37 96.8L27.4 97.2C26.6 97.2 26.1 96.7 26.1 95.9L26.3 61L25.9 24L25.9 8.4C25.9 7.9 26 7.5 26.2 7.2Z"></path>
<path d="M4.1 25.8L26 25.4L38 25.2L63.2 25.6C64.6 25.6 66.2 26.6 67 27.6L67.8 28.6L66.6 30.4L68 32.4L66.4 34.6L67.4 36.2C66.4 36.8 64.8 37 63.6 37L38 36.6L26 36.8L4.3 37.2C3.4 37.2 2.9 36.6 2.9 35.8L2.8 27.2C2.8 26.4 3.3 25.8 4.1 25.8Z"></path>
<path d="M27.2 1.6L28 7.2L27 7.6Z" opacity="0.7"></path>
<path d="M38.6 40L39.2 58L38.6 58Z" opacity="0.5"></path>
</g>
</svg></h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.6; color: #E1E4E8">Our founder Daniel is Baptised &amp; Confirmed in the Anglican Church in Sydney.<br>We hold strongly to the historic Christian beliefs found in the Nicene Creed.</p>
</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 380px), 1fr)); gap: 40px 64px; align-items: start">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px; padding-left: 28px; border-left: 1px solid #3A4048">
<p style="margin: 0; white-space: pre-line; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.75; color: #F1F2F4">We believe in one God,<br>
the Father, the Almighty,<br>
maker of heaven and earth,<br>
of all that is, seen and unseen.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; white-space: pre-line; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.75; color: #F1F2F4">We believe in one Lord, Jesus Christ,<br>
the only Son of God,<br>
eternally begotten of the Father,<br>
God from God, Light from Light,<br>
true God from true God,<br>
begotten, not made,<br>
of one Being with the Father;<br>
through him all things were made.<br>
For us and for our salvation he came down from heaven,<br>
was incarnate from the Holy Spirit and the Virgin Mary<br>
and was made man.<br>
For our sake he was crucified under Pontius Pilate;<br>
he suffered death and was buried.</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px; padding-left: 28px; border-left: 1px solid #3A4048">
<p style="margin: 0; white-space: pre-line; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.75; color: #F1F2F4">On the third day he rose again<br>
in accordance with the Scriptures;<br>
he ascended into heaven<br>
and is seated at the right hand of the Father.<br>
He will come again in glory to judge the living and the dead,<br>
and his kingdom will have no end.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; white-space: pre-line; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.75; color: #F1F2F4">We believe in the Holy Spirit,<br>
the Lord, the giver of life,<br>
who proceeds from the Father and the Son,<br>
who with the Father and the Son is worshipped and glorified,<br>
who has spoken through the prophets.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; white-space: pre-line; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.75; color: #F1F2F4">We believe in one holy catholic and apostolic Church.<br>
We acknowledge one baptism for the forgiveness of sins.<br>
We look for the resurrection of the dead,<br>
and the life of the world to come.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section aria-labelledby="faq-h" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; padding-top: 104px; padding-bottom: 112px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px; align-items: flex-start">
<div style="flex: 1 1 280px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
<h2 id="faq-h" style="margin: 0 0 0 -0.055em; font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5vw, 4.2rem); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.015em">FAQ</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; color: #5A5F66">Something else? <a href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>.</p>
</div>
<div style="flex: 2 1 560px; min-width: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #D9D6CE"><details style="border-top: 1px solid #D9D6CE; padding: 4px 0" open>
<summary style="cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; min-height: 64px; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500">Licensing and CCLI<span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 26px; color: #2F5683">+</span></summary>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 720px; color: #5A5F66">Currently we are not registered to CCLI. We offer our songs right now for free for any Church to use, with credits to our name.</p>
</details><details style="border-top: 1px solid #D9D6CE; padding: 4px 0">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; min-height: 64px; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500">Can I cover and upload your music?<span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 26px; color: #2F5683">+</span></summary>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 720px; color: #5A5F66">Yes! We love seeing all people using our songs. Please credit and tag us too.</p>
</details><details style="border-top: 1px solid #D9D6CE; padding: 4px 0">
<summary style="cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; min-height: 64px; font-size: 21px; font-weight: 500">Is CourtsAbove associated with a Church?<span aria-hidden="true" style="font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', Baskerville, 'Times New Roman', serif; font-size: 26px; color: #2F5683">+</span></summary>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 720px; color: #5A5F66">No, CourtsAbove is not affiliated with a Church. But its members are baptised mostly in Anglican Churches.</p>
</details></div>
</div>
</section>
</Base>
<style is:global>
@media (min-width: 760px){.ql{display:block;white-space:nowrap}}
.dropcap::first-letter{float:left;font-family:'Libre Baskerville',Baskerville,'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:4.6em;line-height:0.82;padding:0.06em 0.14em 0 0;margin-right:0.04em;color:#2F5683}
@media (max-width: 760px){
.menubtn{display:flex !important}
.navlinks{display:none !important}
.navlinks.open{display:flex !important;flex-basis:100%;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:0 !important;padding:4px 0 10px}
.hero,.heroin{min-height:460px !important}
.heroin{padding-top:88px !important;padding-bottom:40px !important}
.heroin figure{top:0 !important}
main section:not(.hero)[style*="padding-top"],main section:not(.hero) > div[style*="padding-top"]{padding-top:56px !important;padding-bottom:56px !important}
main h2[style*="clamp(3rem"]{font-size:2.5rem !important}
main h2[style*="clamp(2.6rem"]{font-size:2.2rem !important}
}
</style>
